        "description": "Espera **422 Unprocessable Entity** (`VehicleDeactivatedException`).\n\nPreparacion: en la coleccion de vehicle, crea un vehiculo y llama a `PATCH /v1/vehicles/{id}/status` para darlo de baja. Luego intenta entrar con esa matricula.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"vehicleType\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('422 Unprocessable Entity', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
              "pm.test('status 422 en el cuerpo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(422));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
